ref_dict.T:main:
\begin{theorem}\label{T:main}
    For $a\in(-1,1)$ and $N\geq 1$, let
    \begin{equation} \label{def:correlation_length}
    \xi=\xi(a,N)\defeq Ne^{-a^2g_N}(\geq 1),
    \end{equation}
    and, with $\capacity_{\R^2}^{\tau}(\cdot)$ as in \eqref{eq:cap_time_change_bm}, and viewing $[0,1]$ as $[0,1]\times\{0\} \subset \R^2$,
      \begin{equation}\label{eq:tau}
    \tau \defeq \tfrac{1}{2} \textnormal{cap}_{\R^2} \big([0,1] \big).
