\end{lemma}
\begin{proof} For the cases $p=0$ and $p=1$, the result is trivial. Next, if $2 \leq p \leq \lceil \frac{n}{2} \rceil$, then $|W(p)|=|G(p)|+|\{\delta_{p, \, i}, \, \, \delta_{p, \, n-i+1}: \, 2\leq i\le p-1\}|$. Thus, by Lemma \ref{nid2}, we see that $$|W(p)|=(n-2p+2)+\sum\limits_{r=p}^{n}{\binom{n}{r}}{\binom{r-1}{p-1}}+2(p-2)=(n-2)+\sum\limits_{r=p}^{n}{\binom{n}{r}}{\binom{r-1}{p-1}}.$$

