\begin{lem}\label{lem-relative-bicentralizer}
 Let $\Gamma \actson M$ be a state preserving outer action of a countable group on a von Neumann algebra. Assume that:
\begin{itemize}
 \item $\Gamma_{\mathrm{mod}}$ is trivial;
