  \label{t:sup_sup_dens}
  Let $v$ be a strong solution to \eqref{eq:rad_N}, for the specific $\rho$ found in Theorem~\ref{t:transform}, under assumptions \eqref{eq:degen} and \eqref{eq:powerlike}, such that $v(x,0)$ is compactly supported and bounded.
  \\
  Then there exist constants $t_{0}$, $C_{*}$, $\rpol_{0}$ and $\varGamma$ such that $\widetilde u(\hat\rpol(\lvertx\rvert),t)$ as in \eqref{eq:sss_sup}--\eqref{eq:sss_ups_2} is a supersolution to \eqref{eq:rad_N}, and
  \begin{equation}
    \label{eq:sup_sup_dens_n}
    v(x,t)
    \le
    \widetilde u(\hat\rpol(\lvertx\rvert),t)
    \,,
    \qquad
    (x,t)\in S_{\infty}
    \,.
  \end{equation}
  We have also
  \begin{equation}
    \label{eq:sup_sup_dens_nn}
    \supp v(t)
    \subset
    B_{\tilde R(t)}(0)
    \,,
    \qquad
    \log \tilde R(t)
    \sim
    \log t
    \,,
