  \label{Theorem: high temp O(N)}
  Fix $N \geq 2$ and let $W_{n} := \sqrt{N-\beta}\,S_{n}/\sqrt{n}$ and $Z \sim N\left(0, \mathbf{I}\right)$, where $\mathbf{I}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}$ is the
