\begin{definition}[multirotations] \label{multrot}
Let $\emptyset\neq C\subset\operatorname{span}\{e_1\}\subset\mathbb{R}^d$ ($d\geq 3$) be a compact set and $\Lambda$ the family of all components (open intervals) of $\operatorname{span}\{e_1\}\setminus C$.
We will call a mapping $\rho:\mathbb{R}^d\to\mathbb{R}^d$ \emph{multirotation} (in $\mathbb{R}^d$) \emph{associated with $C$} if 
