\subsection*{Organization of the paper} In Section~\ref{sec:proof_1.2}, we introduce some notation used throughout the paper and state bounds on $f(n)$, namely Theorems~\ref{thm:lower} and~\ref{thm:upper}, establishing a connection between the asymptotic behavior of $f(n)$ and the Ramsey numbers $R(s,t)$. Theorem~\ref{thm:diagonal_to_ratio} is an immediate consequence of these results, whose proofs appear at the end of Section~\ref{sec:proof_1.2}. In Section~\ref{subsec:numerics}, we establish the numerical bounds of Theorem~\ref{thm:g_upper}. In Appendix~\ref{sec:DiagonalConjecture}, we discuss versions of the Ramsey Diagonal Conjecture and how they relate to Conjecture~\ref{conj:weak.mult.RDC}.

